### Important interim note
Raw Kobo submissions are wide / nested. Completion logic needs a **fact grain** of
one row per `(submission × mentee × activity × topic)` (and skill scores similarly).

Until the Kobo explode transformers land in intermediate:
- Seeds (`mentee_curriculum_tracking_sample`, `process_moh_skills_assessment_sample`,
  `mentee_database_sample`) stand in for processed facts.
- Set `use_sample_seeds: true` (default in `dbt_project.yml`) so models compile offline.
- Flip to `false` once ClickHouse sources + processed intermediates are wired.

