## How to run (once ClickHouse profile exists)
```bash
cd dbt
cp profiles.example.yml ~/.dbt/profiles.yml   # edit host/user/password
dbt deps
dbt seed --select mentee_database_sample mentee_curriculum_tracking_sample process_moh_skills_assessment_sample
dbt run --select +mart_emonc_curriculum_completion +metrics
dbt test --select mart_emonc_curriculum_completion
```

